// เก็บค่าล่าสุดไว้ในหน่วยความจำถาวร จอจะแสดงต่อได้แม้ไฟดับแล้วเปิดใหม่
void loadSaved() {
  store.begin("wx", false);
  if (store.getBytesLength("data") == sizeof(Weather)) {
    store.getBytes("data", &wx, sizeof(Weather));
  }
  store.end();
}

void saveNow() {
  store.begin("wx", false);
  store.putBytes("data", &wx, sizeof(Weather));
  store.end();
}

void ageText(char *out, size_t n) {
  if (!haveFresh) {
    snprintf(out, n, "old");
    return;
  }
  uint32_t s = (millis() - lastUpdateMs) / 1000;
  if (s < 60) snprintf(out, n, "now");
  else if (s < 3600) snprintf(out, n, "%um", (unsigned)(s / 60));
  else snprintf(out, n, "%uh", (unsigned)(s / 3600));
}

static int16_t rdI16(const uint8_t *p) { return (int16_t)(p[0] | (p[1] << 8)); }
static uint16_t rdU16(const uint8_t *p) { return (uint16_t)(p[0] | (p[1] << 8)); }

// ชื่อภาษาอังกฤษ (ใช้กับ Serial)
const char *weatherText(uint8_t c, uint8_t day) {
  if (c == 0) return day ? "Sunny" : "Clear";
  if (c == 1) return "Mostly clear";
  if (c == 2) return "Partly cloudy";
  if (c == 3) return "Overcast";
  if (c == 45 || c == 48) return "Fog";
  if (c >= 51 && c <= 57) return "Drizzle";
  if (c >= 61 && c <= 67) return "Rain";
  if ((c >= 71 && c <= 77) || c == 85 || c == 86) return "Snow";
  if (c >= 80 && c <= 82) return "Showers";
  if (c >= 95) return "Thunderstorm";
  return "-";
}

#if USE_OLED
// ชื่อภาษาไทย (ใช้กับจอ) คืน nullptr ถ้าไม่ทราบ
const Bmp *weatherBmp(uint8_t c, uint8_t day) {
  if (c == 0) return day ? &C_SUNNY : &C_CLEAR;
  if (c == 1) return &C_MOSTLY;
  if (c == 2) return &C_PARTLY;
  if (c == 3) return &C_OVER;
  if (c == 45 || c == 48) return &C_FOG;
  if (c >= 51 && c <= 57) return &C_DRIZ;
  if (c >= 61 && c <= 67) return &C_RAIN;
  if ((c >= 71 && c <= 77) || c == 85 || c == 86) return &C_SNOW;
  if (c >= 80 && c <= 82) return &C_SHOW;
  if (c >= 95) return &C_STORM;
  return nullptr;
}
#endif

// ---------------------------------------------------------------- BLE

class CurCallback : public BLECharacteristicCallbacks {
  void onWrite(BLECharacteristic *ch) override {
    const uint8_t *d = ch->getData();
    size_t len = ch->getLength();
    if (d == nullptr || len < 12) {
      Serial.printf("[BLE] current: ขนาดข้อมูลไม่ถูกต้อง (%u)\n", (unsigned)len);
      return;
    }
    wx.temp  = rdI16(d + 0) / 10.0f;
    wx.hum   = rdU16(d + 2) / 10.0f;
    wx.feels = rdI16(d + 4) / 10.0f;
    wx.press = rdU16(d + 6) / 10.0f;
    wx.code  = d[8];
    wx.isDay = d[9];
    wx.rain  = d[10];
    wx.wind  = d[11];
    wx.haveCur = true;
    lastUpdateMs = millis();
    haveFresh = true;
    saveAt = millis() + 4000;   // รอให้ข้อมูลพยากรณ์ตามมาครบก่อนค่อยบันทึก
    dirty = true;
  }
};

class FcCallback : public BLECharacteristicCallbacks {
  void onWrite(BLECharacteristic *ch) override {
    const uint8_t *d = ch->getData();
    size_t len = ch->getLength();
    if (d == nullptr || len < 17) {
      Serial.printf("[BLE] forecast: ขนาดข้อมูลไม่ถูกต้อง (%u)\n", (unsigned)len);
      return;
    }
    uint8_t chunk = d[0];
    if (chunk > 2) return;
    for (int k = 0; k < 8; k++) {
      wx.fc[chunk * 8 + k] = rdI16(d + 1 + k * 2) / 10.0f;
    }
    wx.fcGot[chunk] = true;
    saveAt = millis() + 4000;
    dirty = true;
  }
};

class InfoCallback : public BLECharacteristicCallbacks {
  void onWrite(BLECharacteristic *ch) override {
    const uint8_t *d = ch->getData();
    size_t len = ch->getLength();
    if (d == nullptr || len < 7) {
      Serial.printf("[BLE] info: ขนาดข้อมูลไม่ถูกต้อง (%u)\n", (unsigned)len);
      return;
    }
    uint32_t epoch = (uint32_t)d[0] | ((uint32_t)d[1] << 8) | ((uint32_t)d[2] << 16) | ((uint32_t)d[3] << 24);
    int16_t tz = rdI16(d + 4);
    wx.prov = (d[6] < 77) ? d[6] : 255;

    timeSeq = timeSeq + 1;                       // เริ่มเขียน (เลขคี่)
    baseMs = millis();
    baseLocal = epoch + (int32_t)tz * 60;
    timeSeq = timeSeq + 1;                       // เขียนเสร็จ (เลขคู่)
    timeOk = true;

    saveAt = millis() + 4000;
    dirty = true;
  }
};

class ServerCallback : public BLEServerCallbacks {
  void onConnect(BLEServer *s) override {
    bleConnected = true;
    dirty = true;
    Serial.println("[BLE] เชื่อมต่อแล้ว");
  }
  void onDisconnect(BLEServer *s) override {
    bleConnected = false;
    dirty = true;
    Serial.println("[BLE] หลุดการเชื่อมต่อ กำลังโฆษณาใหม่...");
    BLEDevice::startAdvertising();
  }
};

void startBle() {
  BLEDevice::init(DEV_NAME);
  server = BLEDevice::createServer();
  server->setCallbacks(new ServerCallback());

  BLEService *svc = server->createService(SVC_UUID);

  BLECharacteristic *cur = svc->createCharacteristic(
      CUR_UUID, BLECharacteristic::PROPERTY_WRITE | BLECharacteristic::PROPERTY_WRITE_NR);
  cur->setCallbacks(new CurCallback());

  BLECharacteristic *fc = svc->createCharacteristic(
      FC_UUID, BLECharacteristic::PROPERTY_WRITE | BLECharacteristic::PROPERTY_WRITE_NR);
  fc->setCallbacks(new FcCallback());

  BLECharacteristic *info = svc->createCharacteristic(
      INFO_UUID, BLECharacteristic::PROPERTY_WRITE | BLECharacteristic::PROPERTY_WRITE_NR);
  info->setCallbacks(new InfoCallback());

  svc->start();

  // UUID 128 บิต + ชื่ออุปกรณ์ รวมกันเกิน 31 ไบต์ จึงแยก: UUID ใน adv, ชื่อใน scan response
  BLEAdvertising *adv = BLEDevice::getAdvertising();
  BLEAdvertisementData advData;
  advData.setFlags(0x06);  // LE General Discoverable + BR/EDR not supported
  advData.setCompleteServices(BLEUUID(SVC_UUID));
  BLEAdvertisementData scanData;
  scanData.setName(DEV_NAME);
  adv->setAdvertisementData(advData);
  adv->setScanResponseData(scanData);
  adv->setScanResponse(true);
  BLEDevice::startAdvertising();

  Serial.println("[BLE] กำลังโฆษณาชื่อ " DEV_NAME);
}

// ------------------------------------------------------------ output

void forecastRange(float &lo, float &hi, bool &ok) {
  ok = false;
  lo = 1000;
  hi = -1000;
  for (int c = 0; c < 3; c++) {
    if (!wx.fcGot[c]) continue;
    for (int k = 0; k < 8; k++) {
      float v = wx.fc[c * 8 + k];
      if (v < lo) lo = v;
      if (v > hi) hi = v;
      ok = true;
    }
  }
}

void printSerial() {
  if (!wx.haveCur) return;
  Serial.println("-------- Weather --------");
  uint32_t ls;
  if (localNow(ls)) {
    int y, m, d;
    civilFromDays(ls / 86400, y, m, d);
    uint32_t sec = ls % 86400;
    Serial.printf("Time      : %04d-%02d-%02d %02u:%02u\n", y, m, d, (unsigned)(sec / 3600), (unsigned)(sec % 3600 / 60));
  }
  Serial.printf("Province  : %d\n", wx.prov);
  Serial.printf("Temp      : %.1f C (feels %.1f C)\n", wx.temp, wx.feels);
  Serial.printf("Humidity  : %.1f %%\n", wx.hum);
  Serial.printf("Pressure  : %.1f hPa\n", wx.press);
  Serial.printf("Wind      : %u km/h\n", wx.wind);
  Serial.printf("Rain prob : %u %%\n", wx.rain);
  Serial.printf("Condition : %s (code %u, %s)\n", weatherText(wx.code, wx.isDay), wx.code,
                wx.isDay ? "day" : "night");
  float lo, hi;
  bool ok;
  forecastRange(lo, hi, ok);
  if (ok) {
    Serial.print("Next 24h  : ");
    for (int i = 0; i < 24; i++) {
      if (wx.fcGot[i / 8]) Serial.printf("%.0f ", wx.fc[i]);
    }
    Serial.printf("\n            min %.1f / max %.1f C\n", lo, hi);
  }
  Serial.println("-------------------------");
}

#if USE_OLED
static bool pageDetail = false;

// วาดบิตแมปไทยสูง 16 พิกเซล คืนตำแหน่ง x ถัดไป
static int drawBmp(int x, int y, const Bmp &b) {
  u8g2.drawXBMP(x, y, b.w, 16, b.d);
  return x + b.w;
}

// วาดข้อความ ASCII ด้วยฟอนต์ 8x16 (เดียวกับตัวอักษรไทย) คืนตำแหน่ง x ถัดไป
static int drawAscii(int x, int y, const char *s) {
  for (; *s; s++) {
    uint8_t c = (uint8_t)*s;
    int idx = (c == 1) ? 95 : ((c >= 32 && c <= 126) ? c - 32 : 0);
    u8g2.drawXBMP(x, y, 8, 16, GLYPH[idx]);
    x += 8;
  }
  return x;
}

static int asciiW(const char *s) { return (int)strlen(s) * 8; }

// หน้าหลัก: จังหวัด / วันที่ / เวลา+อุณหภูมิ / สภาพอากาศ+โอกาสฝน
static void drawMainPage() {
  char buf[40];

  // แถว 1: จังหวัด
  if (wx.prov < 77) drawBmp(0, 0, PROVS[wx.prov]);
  else drawBmp(0, 0, L_NOPROV);

  // แถว 2: วันที่ (พ.ศ.) และแถว 3: เวลา
  uint32_t ls;
  bool t = localNow(ls);
  if (t) {
    uint32_t days = ls / 86400, sec = ls % 86400;
    int y, m, d;
    civilFromDays(days, y, m, d);
    const Bmp &dn = DAYS[(days + 4) % 7];      // 1970-01-01 เป็นวันพฤหัสบดี
    const Bmp &mn = MONTHS[m - 1];
    int be = y + 543;
    snprintf(buf, sizeof(buf), "%d", d);
    char yr[8];
    snprintf(yr, sizeof(yr), "%d", be);
    int w = dn.w + 8 + asciiW(buf) + 8 + mn.w + 8 + asciiW(yr);
    if (w > 128) snprintf(yr, sizeof(yr), "%02d", be % 100);   // ไม่พอ ใช้ปี 2 หลัก
    int x = drawBmp(0, 16, dn);
    x = drawAscii(x + 8, 16, buf);
    x = drawBmp(x + 8, 16, mn);
    drawAscii(x + 8, 16, yr);
    snprintf(buf, sizeof(buf), "%02u:%02u", (unsigned)(sec / 3600), (unsigned)(sec % 3600 / 60));
  } else {
    drawBmp(0, 16, L_NOTIME);
    snprintf(buf, sizeof(buf), "--:--");
  }
  u8g2.setFont(u8g2_font_logisoso16_tr);
  u8g2.drawStr(0, 47, buf);

  // สถานะ BLE และอายุข้อมูล ตัวเล็กตรงกลางแถวเวลา
  char age[8];
  ageText(age, sizeof(age));
  u8g2.setFont(u8g2_font_5x7_tf);
  u8g2.drawStr(58, 39, bleConnected ? "BLE" : "---");
  u8g2.drawStr(58, 47, age);

  // อุณหภูมิ ชิดขวาของแถวเวลา
  snprintf(buf, sizeof(buf), "%.1f" DEG "C", wx.temp);
  drawAscii(128 - asciiW(buf), 32, buf);

  // แถว 4: สภาพอากาศ + โอกาสฝน
  const Bmp *c = weatherBmp(wx.code, wx.isDay);
  if (c) drawBmp(0, 48, *c);
  else drawAscii(0, 48, "-");
  snprintf(buf, sizeof(buf), "%u%%", (unsigned)wx.rain);
  int rw = L_RAIN.w + 8 + asciiW(buf);
  int rx = drawBmp(128 - rw, 48, L_RAIN);
  drawAscii(rx + 8, 48, buf);
}

// หน้ารายละเอียด: ความชื้น+ความกด / รู้สึกเหมือน / ลม / ช่วงอุณหภูมิ 24 ชม.
static void drawDetailPage() {
  char buf[40];
  int x;

  x = drawBmp(0, 0, L_HUM);
  snprintf(buf, sizeof(buf), "%.0f%%", wx.hum);
  x = drawAscii(x + 8, 0, buf);
  snprintf(buf, sizeof(buf), "%.0fhPa", wx.press);
  drawAscii(x + 8, 0, buf);

  x = drawBmp(0, 16, L_FEEL);
  snprintf(buf, sizeof(buf), "%.1f" DEG "C", wx.feels);
  drawAscii(x + 8, 16, buf);

  x = drawBmp(0, 32, L_WIND);
  snprintf(buf, sizeof(buf), "%u", (unsigned)wx.wind);
  x = drawAscii(x + 8, 32, buf);
  drawBmp(x + 8, 32, L_KMH);

  x = drawBmp(0, 48, L_24H);
  float lo, hi;
  bool ok;
  forecastRange(lo, hi, ok);
  if (ok) snprintf(buf, sizeof(buf), "%.0f-%.0f" DEG "C", lo, hi);
  else snprintf(buf, sizeof(buf), "--");
  drawAscii(x + 8, 48, buf);
}

void drawOled() {
  u8g2.clearBuffer();
  if (!wx.haveCur) {
    drawBmp(0, 0, L_TITLE);
    drawAscii(0, 16, "ESP32 Weather");
    drawBmp(0, 32, L_WAIT);
    drawBmp(0, 48, bleConnected ? L_CONN : L_WAITCONN);
    u8g2.sendBuffer();
    return;
  }
#if SHOW_DETAIL_PAGE
  if (pageDetail) drawDetailPage();
  else drawMainPage();
#else
  drawMainPage();
#endif
  u8g2.sendBuffer();
}
#endif

// -------------------------------------------------------------- main

void setup() {
  Serial.begin(115200);
  delay(300);
  Serial.println("\nESP32 Weather Receiver");

#if USE_OLED
  u8g2.setI2CAddress(OLED_ADDR * 2);
  u8g2.begin();
#endif

  loadSaved();   // แสดงค่าล่าสุดที่เคยได้รับทันที ไม่ต้องรอมือถือ
#if USE_OLED
  drawOled();
#endif

  startBle();
}

void loop() {
  static uint32_t lastFlip = 0;
  static int32_t lastMinute = -1;

  if (saveAt != 0 && (int32_t)(millis() - saveAt) >= 0) {
    saveAt = 0;
    saveNow();
  }

  bool redraw = false;
  if (dirty) {
    dirty = false;
    printSerial();
    redraw = true;
  }

  // ขึ้นนาทีใหม่ -> รีทันที ให้เวลาบนจอตรง
  uint32_t ls;
  if (localNow(ls)) {
    int32_t mi = (int32_t)(ls / 60);
    if (mi != lastMinute) {
      lastMinute = mi;
      redraw = true;
    }
  }

  // รีเฟรชทุก REFRESH_MS (30 วินาที) และสลับหน้า
  if (millis() - lastFlip >= REFRESH_MS) {
    lastFlip = millis();
#if USE_OLED && SHOW_DETAIL_PAGE
    pageDetail = !pageDetail;
#endif
    redraw = true;
  }

#if USE_OLED
  if (redraw) drawOled();
#endif
  delay(50);
}
